title: The Cyprus settlement
view-if: cyprus_campaign_resolved == 1
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! if(AnatolianRules.cyprusRoadmap.startEndingMusic)AnatolianRules.cyprusRoadmap.startEndingMusic(Q); !}

= [? if cyprus_final_result == "Return to the 1960 Constitutional Order" : 30 August 1974, ?]Cyprus, [+ cyprus_final_result +]

[? if cyprus_campaign_resolved == 1 : <img class="cyprus-ending-map" src="[+ {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusRoadmap.endingMap(Q); !} +]" alt="Map of the final Cyprus settlement" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin:1em auto;background:#000;"> ?]

[? if cyprus_final_result == "Non-Intervention" : CHP was not in power when the crisis began. Turkey did not undertake this intervention, and the opportunity to secure the Turkish Cypriot position was lost. ?]
[? if cyprus_final_result == "Military Defeat" : <h2>MAĞLUP</h2> ?]

[? if cyprus_final_result == "Military Defeat" : The operation has failed. Our forces could not establish a sustainable military position, or suffered a breakdown so serious that the campaign's objectives could no longer be secured. The men sent to protect the Turkish community have endured losses without obtaining the position from which Ankara intended to dictate the next stage of the crisis. ?]

[? if cyprus_final_result == "Military Defeat" : There can be no triumphal account of this result. The government must confront the failure of the operation, safeguard the surviving troops and face the consequences of an intervention that did not achieve its essential purpose. The political settlement Turkey had hoped to secure through Atilla I is now beyond its reach. ?]

[? if cyprus_final_result == "Denktaş Plan" : The parties agree to a federal Cyprus with a clearly defined Turkish region in the north and a Greek region in the south. ?]
[? if cyprus_final_result == "Güneş Plan" : The parties agree to a federal Cyprus containing six geographically separate autonomous Turkish cantons. ?]
[? if cyprus_final_result == "Historical Division" : The second operation is followed by the historical territorial division. A comprehensive federal agreement remains unresolved. ?]

[? if cyprus_best_ending == 1 : The Güneş settlement has been achieved without Atilla II, with strong UN cooperation: the campaign's best diplomatic outcome. ?]

[+ {! return Q.cyprus_atilla2_started || Q.cyprus_atilla2_complete ? "Atilla I" : "Atilla"; !} +] score: [+ cyprus_atilla1_score +] / 720.

[? if cyprus_atilla2_complete == 1 : Atilla II score: [+ cyprus_atilla2_score +] / [? if cyprus_campaign_version == 2 : [+ {! return Q.cyprus_delayed_ceasefire ? 320 : 240; !} +] ?][? if cyprus_campaign_version != 2 : 240 ?]. ?]

[? if cyprus_campaign_version == 2 and cyprus_final_result == "Historical Division" : Later diplomacy remains possible through Foreign Ministry → Manage Our Relations with the West → Cyprus Negotiations. The Güneş route requires Friendly US and Western Europe relations and four rounds; the Denktaş route requires Very Friendly relations with both and six rounds. ?]

[+ {! return AnatolianRules.cyprusRoadmap.endingPraise ? AnatolianRules.cyprusRoadmap.endingPraise(Q).replace(/\n\n/g,'<br><br>') : ""; !} +]

[? if cyprus_poll_reward_paid == 1 : The achievement increases CHP polling by [? if cyprus_atilla2_complete == 1 : 5 ?][? if cyprus_atilla2_complete != 1 : 3 ?] percentage points. ?]

- @root: [+ {! return Q.cyprus_final_result==='Güneş Plan'?"We have done it!":"Let us return to our people."; !} +]

@root
on-arrival: {! if(!AnatolianRules.cyprusRoadmap.beginRally || !AnatolianRules.cyprusRoadmap.beginRally(Q))AnatolianRules.cyprusCampaign.exit(Q); !}
go-to: cyprus_sarachane_rally if cyprus_rally_pending == 1; post_event if cyprus_rally_pending != 1

